# Wave W17-X (Route 210 — North): fog sand — fog-road sand, design-authorised: an honest pale sand kept luminous, the path appearing and vanishing is a weather effect, the kind stays plain light sand the bells can find (design: the path appearing and vanishing under the mist, waybells standing in the murk). Split from Route 210’s warm ranch sand by the pallor entire — fog light vs pasture light.
